        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "When we translate sustainability into quantifiable business intelligence, we proactively manage non-financial risks and capitalize on the market demand for transparent, sustainable enterprise solutions.",
